    "description": "Natural Mineral Specimen Lot - 2 Pieces\nAmethyst and Titanium Aura Quartz\nVintage Collection\nThis two-piece mineral collection features distinct geological specimens prized for their crystalline structure and color. The lot includes a classic natural amethyst cluster and a treated aura quartz specimen, representing both natural formations and enhanced mineral aesthetics popular in mid-century and modern lapidary collections.\nPieces Included:\nNatural Amethyst Cluster - Approximately 3 inches wide, featuring deep purple crystalline points on a natural rocky matrix base.\nTitanium Aura Quartz Cluster - Approximately 2.5 inches wide, featuring a metallic iridescent coating with rainbow hues of gold, purple, and blue over a crystal base.\nCondition:\nBoth specimens are in excellent vintage condition. The crystal points are well-defined with no significant post-extraction damage. Natural matrix variations and surface textures are consistent with authentic mineral specimens. No visible repairs or synthetic reconstructions.\nThank you for all of your support!",
